  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 10. Documented [1]: +/-12 dB from unity at noon, Low at 125 Hz, Mid at 1 kHz, High at\n3.2 kHz; active Baxandall-style stages are reported for the series [3]. The circuits here are graphic-EQ bands (chosen) whose\nnetworks are set to those documented frequencies and that range. LX3, LX4: simulated inductors (gyrators). Low and High are\nfirst-order shelves here; the DSP's (pk.lowShelf2, pk.highShelf2) are second-order, so steeper." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21f2f366-2be2-55df-8c40-9fe453cb8bed"))
